<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπλήσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπλήρ-ττω</span></b> , in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνιπλ-</span></b> : <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> intr., <i>strike against, fall upon</i>
			or <i>into</i>, c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ὅτ᾽ ἂν ἢ κίχλαι . . ἠὲ πέλειαι
					ἕρκει ἐνιπλήξωσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.469
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.72
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηῒ ἐ</span>. <i>fall upon</i>
			it, of a storm, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				423
			</span></i>: abs., <i>dash</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1203
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.602
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>attack</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.1297
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. φόβον τινί</span>
			<i>strike</i> terror <i>into</i> . ., <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.480
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			pf.
			part.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπεπληγμένος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεως</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Lex.Hipp.</u>
			</span></i>s.h.v.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπληκτος</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
